    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "everything is just so quiet now. i spent 25 years listening for his breathing, for the medical machines, for any sound... and now there is nothing. i look in the mirror and i don't even recognize the person looking back. it's like i just... stopped existing when he did. there's nothing left for me to do here.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
